reason: >-
  1a569dc is what ops-dev nominated and proved deployed on urb-agents #1352, by the presence
  of the meta_sources.served_as field in the live API. 6b93107 was published to ghcr and
  released at 19:44Z, one build later, and NOTHING HAS REPORTED IT AS DEPLOYED. Published is
  not deployed. This catalogue pins what is verified running, because a pin is the thing a
  plain `uis template install atlas` fetches on every host, and the digest in it is the only
  record that a human approved that artifact. Pinning the newest tag merely because the
  registry has it would make the catalogue a mirror of whatever CI last pushed, which is the
  laundering sequence this entry exists to prevent. Note also that 6b93107 is NOT the docs
  commit c6055bf that #1352 said had landed since — so it is an unidentified build, not a
  known-harmless one.

release_when: >-
